1
00:00:00,966 --> 00:00:05,506
(Sheldon:)Leonard made me soup,
and I was mean to him.

2
00:00:05,504 --> 00:00:07,774
(Sheldon:)I was mean to him.

3
00:00:07,772 --> 00:00:10,172
(Sheldon:)He must have felt terrible.

4
00:00:10,175 --> 00:00:13,175
(Sheldon:)Oh, now I feel terrible.

5
00:00:13,178 --> 00:00:15,578
Neat!

6
00:00:16,414 --> 00:00:18,084
(Amy:)Glad I could help.

7
00:00:18,083 --> 00:00:20,153
(Sheldon:)Now let me see you
feel bad for lying

8
00:00:20,151 --> 00:00:22,751
(Sheldon:)and staying in Detroit
longer than you needed to.

9
00:00:22,754 --> 00:00:26,294
(flatly):
I feel so, so bad.

10
00:00:26,291 --> 00:00:29,261
(Sheldon:)Hey, we're both great at this.

11
00:00:32,998 --> 00:00:35,968
(Sheldon:)Leonard, get ready
for an apology.

12
00:00:35,967 --> 00:00:39,107
(Sheldon:)And with the added twist
of an M. Night Shyamalan movie,

13
00:00:39,104 --> 00:00:41,104
(Sheldon:)I'm going to mean it.

14
00:00:41,106 --> 00:00:42,776
(Leonard:)Ah, so like every other

15
00:00:42,774 --> 00:00:44,344
(Sheldon:)M. Night Shyamalan movie
I've seen,

16
00:00:44,342 --> 00:00:47,042
(Leonard:)you spoil it in advance.

17
00:00:47,045 --> 00:00:48,615
(Sheldon:)Hey, if you didn't know
Bruce Willis

18
00:00:48,613 --> 00:00:51,483
(Sheldon:)was dead the whole time,
that's not on me.

19
00:00:53,518 --> 00:00:55,088
(Raj:)Okay.

20
00:00:55,086 --> 00:00:56,556
(Sheldon:)Here it comes.

21
00:00:56,555 --> 00:00:57,885
(Sheldon:)You tried to take care of me

22
00:00:57,889 --> 00:01:00,159
(Sheldon:)when I was sick,
and I was mean to you.

